# Golden G-M0-1: soft-thru routing + panic (DESIGN.md §29.5 G3 shape).
# A note enters kbd at tick 0, is routed to synth; panic at tick 10 silences
# it with an explicit NoteOff plus the three channel-mode CCs.
port open in kbd
port open out synth
thru kbd synth
@0 midi send kbd 90 3C 64
@10 panic
advance 48
quit
